	column 'Prior Z Value' = ```
			
			     CALCULATE(
			         ('Test'[Test P Prime Z Value]),
			         FILTER('Test','Test'[Test_YearMonthIndex]=EARLIER('Test'[Test_YearMonthIndex])-1) --filter to prior index value to grab value
			     )
			```
		lineageTag: 96659dfb-a4ec-49c0-9273-bda0bd2a93d4
		summarizeBy: sum

